{"id":"method-fraction-split-range","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>分离后商为常数、余项分子至多一次、分母至多二次的固定系数分式及准确输入范围。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>原函数的完整值域和边界取值证据。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>原式禁取点与端点开闭均保留。一次余项先处理零点，再按需换元、同除，分支求中间函数的准确范围。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"separate\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>分离常数与整理分式</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#separate\" aria-label=\"定位到分离常数与整理分式\">#</a></div><p>验证分离恒等式；一次余项检查分子零点，按需换元，在非零分支分子分母同除。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-fraction-split/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分式分离</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"solve\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>求中间函数的范围</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#solve\" aria-label=\"定位到求中间函数的范围\">#</a></div><p>常数余项求分母范围；一次余项求对勾函数或退化中间函数的范围，按实际输入分段，核对端点与转折点。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-quadratic-interval-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>二次函数区间值域法</a></li><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-reciprocal-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>求对勾函数在区间上的最值与值域</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"restore\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>取倒数并还原值域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#restore\" aria-label=\"定位到取倒数并还原值域\">#</a></div><p>对分母各正负分量取倒数，再按比例和平移还原；合并同除时排除但原式合法的零点输出。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-inequality-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>不等式变形与推导</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><h3>核验完整值域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到核验完整值域\">#</a></div><p>从原函数独立核验完整输出及边界的合法原像。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#identity\">等式的性质 · 等值替换与定义域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/function-range-extrema/#attainability\">函数的值域与最值 · 边界可达性</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#addition\">不等式的性质 · 同加减与同向相加</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#multiplication\">不等式的性质 · 乘除与方向</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#reciprocal\">不等式的性质 · 同号两数取倒数</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/quadratic-function-properties/#interval\">二次函数 · 区间上的值域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/quadratic-function-properties/#vertex\">二次函数 · 开口、对称轴与顶点</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/real-order/#difference\">不等式与实数大小关系 · 作差判号</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/reciprocal-sum-function/#monotonicity\">对勾函数 · 四个单调区间</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/reciprocal-sum-function/#range\">对勾函数 · 最值与值域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/square-nonnegative/#nonnegative\">平方的非负性 · 平方非负</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 一次分式</h3><p class=\"problem\">求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{x+1}{x-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 的值域。</p><ol><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ne2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord katex-vbox\"><span class=\"katex-thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"katex-fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>，</span><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1+\\frac3{x-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span clas